usage: plan.py schema [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--verbs]
                      [{plan,brief,phase,item,unit,decision,log-event,document,snapshot,envelope,bridge,check-evidence,read-get,read-list,read-events,read-artifact,read-links,read-neighborhood,read-catalog,read-commits,read-ready,defs}]

read a document schema or the API catalog (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  {plan,brief,phase,item,unit,decision,log-event,document,snapshot,envelope,bridge,check-evidence,read-get,read-list,read-events,read-artifact,read-links,read-neighborhood,read-catalog,read-commits,read-ready,defs}
                        plan/v1 schema kind

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --verbs               describe all verbs (default when no kind is given)
